  "Software Details": "Yazılım Detayları",
  "The Consignment Module integration in Dash SaaS streamlines the creation and management of consignment agreements for businesses. Within the platform, users can easily generate customized consignment agreements tailored to their specific needs. These agreements can include detailed terms and conditions, pricing structures, commission rates, Tax calculation and inventory specifications. By providing a centralized platform for agreement creation, businesses can ensure consistency and accuracy across all their consignment partnerships, fostering stronger relationships with consignment partners and minimizing the risk of disputes.": "Dash SaaS'taki Konsinye Modülü entegrasyonu, işletmeler için konsinye sözleşmelerinin oluşturulmasını ve yönetimini kolaylaştırır. ",
  "/Month": "/Ay",
  "/Year": "/Yıl",
  "Buy Now": "Şimdi al",
  "View Live Demo": "Canlı Demoyu Görüntüle",
  "Efficient ": "Verimli ",
  " Inventory Tracking ": " Envanter Takibi ",
  " and Management": " ve Yönetim",
  "With the Consignment Module, businesses can efficiently track and manage consigned inventory within Dash SaaS. ": "Konsinye Modülü ile işletmeler, Dash SaaS içerisinde sevk edilen envanteri verimli bir şekilde takip edebilir ve yönetebilir. ",
  "Viewing and Pricing Products in Consignment": "Konsinye Ürünleri Görüntüleme ve Fiyatlandırma",
  "The Commission Module allows users to view a comprehensive list of products in consignment, ensuring complete visibility over inventory. Additionally, users can manage and update the pricing of these consigned products, which is essential for accurate commission calculations. This feature ensures that all commission-related transactions reflect the most current product prices, maintaining transparency and precision in payouts. You can also add the tax in your consignment while pricing.": "Komisyon Modülü, kullanıcıların sevkıyattaki ürünlerin kapsamlı bir listesini görüntülemesine olanak tanıyarak envanter üzerinde tam görünürlük sağlar. ",
  "Creating and Converting Purchase Orders": "Satınalma Siparişleri Oluşturma ve Dönüştürme",
  "In the Commission Module, users can create detailed purchase orders and seamlessly convert these orders into actual purchases. This streamlined process ensures that procurement activities are efficiently managed and that all purchases are accurately recorded for commission calculations. By automating the conversion of purchase orders, the module reduces manual effort and enhances the accuracy of the procurement and commission tracking processes.": "Komisyon Modülü'nde kullanıcılar detaylı satınalma siparişleri oluşturabilir ve bu siparişleri sorunsuz bir şekilde gerçek satın almalara dönüştürebilir. ",
  "Creating and Converting Sale Orders": "Satış Siparişleri Oluşturma ve Dönüştürme",
  "The Commission Module also supports the creation of sale orders, which can be easily converted into finalized sales. This functionality is crucial for tracking sales performance and ensuring that commissions are calculated based on completed transactions. By automating the sale order conversion process, the module ensures timely and precise commission payouts, aligning sales": "Komisyon Modülü aynı zamanda kolaylıkla kesinleşmiş satışa dönüştürülebilecek satış siparişlerinin oluşturulmasını da destekler. ",
